erman won't break down and the battle  if there was one would be one  similar to batman vs superman with a bed  you would have a martyr who sacrificed  himself for the earth  this is how the storyline of the two  parts could look like a few ideas have  been interpreted based on the scenes  we've already seen but other plot ideas  originate from snyder himself  as mentioned before the concepts have  actually already been put together  now fans just have to keep hoping that  the snyder cut becomes such a success  that warner will once again roll back  and turn the ideas  into reality another question that has  to be asked is whether all the actors  would still be available  particularly superman actor henry cavill  and batman ben affleck have found new  roles after the project was grabbed  cavalier in particular has a lot to do  with the filming of the witcher and if  the second season is as successful as  the first one  many more will surely follow things are  different for affleck who has reportedly  already given his ok for a comeback in  the upcoming flash movie if the cast  were to come together he certainly  wouldn't say no  cyborg actor ray fisher will surely be  more satisfied after the release of the  snyder cut ii  this is because his story and  development are the focus as it was  actually intended before however this  was cut out almost  entirely in the 2017 theatrical version  which the actor also found quite  upsetting in retrospect with  snyder however he would certainly work  together again since further solo films  are planned for wonder woman and aquaman  anyway they could of course continue to  be cast in justice league  the same goes for azramilah and the  character of the flash  therefore it doesn't seem to be a  mammoth task to get the crew together  again  not even caval could turn down the  opportunity if all his other castmates  were to persuade him to join them  before the video ends we have dealt with  a subject that will certainly also be o